BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260730T231500Z
DTEND:20260731T012000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T231500Z
UID:dZjB0Aj28C
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 cinema/in-theaters/the-invite\n\nEstimated start: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Piano (1993)
DTSTART:20260731T021500Z
DTEND:20260731T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260731T021500Z
UID:CsseewtiSf
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 117 mins (1h57m)\n\n1851. Ada has never spoken a wor
 d since the age of six and only communicates through music and her daughte
 r\, Flora. An arranged marriage forces her to leave her native Scotland wi
 th her daughter and her piano. Her destination is New Zealand\, where she 
 is awaited by Stewart\, a farmer with whom she has nothing in common. Her 
 suffering only gets worse when her husband sells the piano to his neighbou
 r George. But Ada will find a way to continue playing in exchange for givi
 ng George lessons. New 4K Restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-t
 heaters/the-piano\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maddie's Secret
DTSTART:20260726T200000Z
DTEND:20260726T220500Z
DTSTAMP:20260726T200000Z
UID:Gg04sWEkVN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nUnmissable directorial debut sat
 irizing and skewering content culture from iconic alt-comedian John Early\
 , who plays the titular role\, alongside a troupe of comedians including K
 ate Berlant\, Vanessa Bayer\, and Conner O’Malley.  From July 17 to 19\,
  all 7:00pm screenings will include a pre-recorded Q&A with John Early and
  one of these special guests:July 17 - Amy SedarisJuly 18 - Hannah Einbind
 erJuly 19 - Sarah Sherman\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/maddi
 es-secret-yr\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
